312 - Near the Cross
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 312
Topic: Gospel - 

Verse 1:
[F/C]Jesus, [Gm/D]keep [F/C]me [C7/Bb]near the [Dm/A]cross; [Bb]there a precious [Dm/A]fountain,
[F/C]Free to all, ahealing stream, [Gm/D]flows from [F/C]Calvary's [C7/Bb]mountain.
[Bb]In the cross, [F]in the cross, be my [C/G]glory [C7/Bb]ever,
[F/C]Till my [Am]raptured [Gm/D]soul shall [Dm/F]find rest [F]beyond the [Dm/F]river.

Refrain:
[F/C]In the cross, in [C]the cross,
[F]be my [Bb/F]glory [Edim]ever,
[Dm/F]till my raptured [F]soul shall find
[C/G]rest beyond [C7/Bb]the river.

Verse 2:
[F/C]Near [Gm/D]the [F/C]cross, [Dm/A]a [Bb]trembling [Dm/A]soul,
[F/C]love and [C]mercy [F/C]found [C7/Bb]me;
[Bb]there the [F]bright and morning [C7/Bb]star
[F/C]sheds [Am]its [Gm/D]beams [Dm/F]around me.

Verse 3:
[F/C]Near [Gm/D]the [F/C]cross! [Dm/A]O [Bb]Lamb [Am]of [Dm/A]God,
[F/C]bring its [C]scenes [Gm/D]before [C7/Bb]me;
[Bb]help me [F]walk from day [C/G]to [C7/Bb]day
[F/C]with [Am]its [Gm/D]shadow [F]o'er [Dm/F]me.

Verse 4:
[F/C]Near [Gm/D]the [F/C]cross [Dm/A]I'll [Bb]watch [Am]and [Dm/A]wait,
[F/C]hoping, [C]trusting [F/C]ever,
[Bb]till I [F]reach the golden [C7/Bb]strand
[F/C]just [Am]beyond [Gm/D]the [Dm/F]river.
